        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>麻腮风疫苗</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    color: #4a4a4a;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 40px 20px;\n  }\n  .container {\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #333333;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  hr {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n  }\n  .intro {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #555555;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .qa-item {\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n  }\n  .question {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #444444;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .highlight {\n    color: #db4b4b;\n  }\n  .answer {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #666666;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n  .answer p {\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .answer p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h1>麻腮风疫苗</h1>\n    <hr>\n    <div class=\"intro\">\n      麻腮风是预防麻疹、腮腺炎、风疹联合减毒活疫苗。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n      <div class=\"question\">1. 接种完当晚<span class=\"highlight\">发热</span>正常么？</div>\n      <div class=\"answer\">\n        <p>发热皮疹比较常见，是由疫苗特性决定的。抗原植入到产生抗体通常反应时间是8-10天。红疹持续2-3天后会消退。</p>\n        <p>发热物理降温，温度高用退烧药。</p>\n        <p>没有严重的过敏反应，1岁半还是要打第二针。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n      <div class=\"question\">2. 麻腮风需要全蛋<span class=\"highlight\">排敏</span>么？</div>\n      <div class=\"answer\">\n        <p>不需要，正常接种。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n      <div class=\"question\">3. 麻腮风接种后需要<span class=\"highlight\">注意</span>什么？</div>\n      <div class=\"answer\">\n        <p>8-10天可能会出现疫苗反应，发热小红疹子（前胸后背）。提前备好退热药物。之前如果孩子容易长皮疹红疹，暂停添加新的辅食。轻微皮疹可以用炉甘石。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n      <div class=\"question\">4. 麻腮风第一针后多久<span class=\"highlight\">没事</span>？</div>\n      <div class=\"answer\">\n        <p>两周后没反应就没事。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"qa-item\">\n      <div class=\"question\">5. 麻腮风打过多久可以<span class=\"highlight\">洗澡出门</span>？</div>\n      <div class=\"answer\">\n        <p>24小时内暂停洗澡，之后正常洗澡出门。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
